<title>USA: Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.37		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net			 98,400		   85,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,052,500		  958,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  72,000		   73,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 net includes tax credit of $40 million and after-tax charge of $37 million related to U.K. real estate and the integration of insurance services operations. Net impact of both items increased per share income by $0.04.  </p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $6.34		    $5.53</p>
<p> Net			459,300		  402,900</p>
<p> Revs		   4,149,000		3,770,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  72,400		   72,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call consensus analyst estimate for 1996 Q4 was $1.29/shr.</p>
</text>
